      "writtenOn": "2022-08-11T18:37:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It should be sLog (s for static). We mostly use the all-caps spelling for string literals or const ints (essentially what would be a constexpr in C++ or #define in C). Static objects usually use \"s{Name}\" (see https://source.corp.google.com/android/packages/modules/Connectivity/service/src/com/android/server/BpfNetMaps.java for instance).",
      "parentUuid": "ab59433a_093c6d21",
