      "writtenOn": "2022-08-11T07:26:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "NetlinkMonitor has included SharedLog parameter, we could just use the default one maintained in this class(e.g. at L162 just pass the sLog), for Handler, it\u0027s passed-in from outside caller. Having one parameter keeps constructor simpler.",
