      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is \"Rtm\" in this case? Looks like it is related to the RTM messages the monitor will react to? I\u0027m wondering if there might be more readable naming to use at this layer vs reusing the native layer naming? I.e., `onLinkAdded`?\n\nDoes this method also get called for link state updates (as per the `if` statement on l.167) and not just added interfaces? In that case, maybe `onLinkStateChanged`?",
