      "message": "Agreed that this is a little hard to read. updateInterfaceLinkState is overloaded and not entirely correct as the callbacks can also add / remove interfaces.\nI will rename them to onNewLink() and onDelLink(), which is close enough to RTM_NEWLINK / RTM_DELLINK (so it reflects their intent) and easier to read.\n\nre James: RTM_NEWLINK messages are sent by the kernel when an interface is added and when the interface flags change.",
